Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:05:02 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] PC-CRT: keep the game window DPI-aware, fix screenshot
 file names

- fix_dpi_unaware (default on): block SetThreadDpiAwarenessContext requests
  for DPI-unaware contexts (HoMM3 HD switches its window thread to UNAWARE),
  which made Windows scale the window at 150-200% while the renderer drew
  in physical pixels: frame decimated 2:1, mouse limited to part of screen.
- Screenshots: replace characters Windows forbids in file names, so a title
  like "Game: Subtitle" no longer ends up in an NTFS alternate data stream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015iNvQWbpUqvH4LBuQbm3ET
